{
  "_note": "Iwara（iwara.tv）。整站含 api 都在 Cloudflare 盾后 → web.shield 必须声明；封面图床 i.iwara.tv 没盾，走普通 okhttp。播放是两跳：/video/{id} 给 fileUrl，fileUrl 回来的是清晰度清单（不是视频），清单里的 src.view 才是直链，而那个主机名每次从固定池里随机挑 —— 所以 http.hosts 列的是实测到的整池，漏一个的表现是「能看详情、点播放报主机不在白名单」。",
  "origin": "https://www.iwara.tv",
  "headers": {
    "User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 14; Pixel 8) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/130.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36",
    "Referer": "https://www.iwara.tv/",
    "Accept": "application/json, text/plain, */*"
  },
  "cover": {
    "mode": "plain",
    "allowedHosts": [
      "i.iwara.tv"
    ],
    "hostRewrites": {}
  },
  "http": {
    "_why": "播放层出口。filesq 是签名清单那一跳；其余是视频直链的随机主机池（站点把 Honkai/星铁的角色名当 CDN 别名轮换）。实测 2026-10-19：抽查 120 条视频的清单共出现 13 个不同主机，两次请求同一条视频主机名就会变。池子是固定的，但新名字会陆续出现 —— 真机日志里如果出现「主机不在播放层白名单里：xxx.iwara.tv」，把那个名字补进来即可。",
    "hosts": [
      "filesq.iwara.tv",
      "files.iwara.tv",
      "acheron.iwara.tv",
      "aiko.iwara.tv",
      "asta.iwara.tv",
      "bailu.iwara.tv",
      "blade.iwara.tv",
      "bronya.iwara.tv",
      "camellya.iwara.tv",
      "clara.iwara.tv",
      "firefly.iwara.tv",
      "hanya.iwara.tv",
      "herta.iwara.tv",
      "hime.iwara.tv",
      "himeko.iwara.tv",
      "hook.iwara.tv",
      "jade.iwara.tv",
      "kafka.iwara.tv",
      "lumi.iwara.tv",
      "mikoto.iwara.tv",
      "naja.iwara.tv",
      "pela.iwara.tv",
      "phoebe.iwara.tv",
      "robin.iwara.tv",
      "silverwolf.iwara.tv",
